  "description": "Min-Joo has a pretty appearance that would make men look at her at least once. Her job is an internet broadcaster. Two black shadows slowly approach Min-Joo, who was just running with her dreams of increasing the number of viewers and becoming famous. It cannot be taken lightly. 'Bite each other to death.' A suspenseful romantic thriller that moves between the online world and the world of three young men and women.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
